# The Java image build context is the repo root: drop what is not needed so the build is fast and local secrets stay out of the context.
.git
**/target
dev/.local
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
**/dist
# contracts/terminology/dist is committed generated source (export_terminology.py), not build
# output: the Java modules embed it in the jar at build time, so it must stay in the context.
!contracts/terminology/dist
